{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Segment, RudderStack and Customer.io Data Pipelines each take the same batch call of the Segment","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spec, at endpoints of their own. One encoder, ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/SegmentSpecBatchEncoder"},{"text":", writes it, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"factory for each fills in the endpoint and how the key travels:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/segment(writeKey:region:plan:backoff:clock:)","isActive":true},{"text":" posts to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"\/v1\/batch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of the workspace’s region (","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/SegmentRegion","isActive":true},{"text":"), with the write key as HTTP Basic","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"authentication’s user name and an empty password.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/rudderStack(writeKey:dataPlane:plan:backoff:clock:)"},{"text":" posts to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"code":"\/v1\/batch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of your data plane URL, with the write key the same way.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/customerIO(apiKey:region:plan:backoff:clock:)"},{"type":"text","text":" posts to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Pipelines API’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/v1\/batch"},{"type":"text","text":" in the workspace’s region ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/CustomerIORegion"},{"type":"text","text":"), with the key as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bearer token and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"X-Strict-Mode: 1"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each splits a batch to the spec’s limits (","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/SegmentSpecBatchEncoder\/batchLimit","isActive":true},{"text":"): 2,500 calls","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and 500 KB a request, and under 32 KB a call, which all three accept. A batch with no record the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"encoder can write, an empty one included, makes no request. Each retries no response, a 5xx, 408","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and 429, and drops and reports any other status. No trace context is sent. ","type":"text"},{"code":"import Traffluent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"leaves this module out; import it on its own.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The key goes in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Authorization","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" header field, never in the body. It is a public client key:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Segment’s and RudderStack’s write keys, and Customer.io’s public keys (","type":"text"},{"code":"pk_…","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), ship in their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vendors’ own app and web libraries, and they let a client send data to the source and read","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nothing.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Customer.io’s private keys (","type":"text"},{"code":"sk_…","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") reach every Customer.io API, deleting people included, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the factory throws ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/CustomerIOSetupError\/privateKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for one. Each factory throws for an empty","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/SegmentSetupError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/RudderStackSetupError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/CustomerIOSetupError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"), RudderStack’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for a data plane URL that isn’t a plain ","type":"text"},{"code":"https","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" URL, and Customer.io’s for a public key of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other region.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A region has no default. Segment and Customer.io keep a workspace’s data in the US or the EU, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"events posted to the other region’s endpoint don’t reach it, so you pick the region on purpose.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each record becomes a track call of an anonymous user. Its ","type":"text"},{"code":"anonymousId","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the record’s session,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from the sessions enricher; a record with no session is sent under its own record identifier. No","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"userId","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"identify","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" call or traits are sent. Its ","type":"text"},{"code":"messageId","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the record’s identifier, which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a redelivered record keeps, and its ","type":"text"},{"code":"timestamp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the record’s timestamp in ISO 8601 with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"milliseconds. The record’s vendor identifier and trace context aren’t sent. The standard context","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"goes in the spec’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"context","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" fields (","type":"text"},{"code":"app","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"device","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"locale","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"network","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"os","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), with no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"device.id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"advertisingId","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every call’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"context.ip"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0.0.0.0"},{"type":"text","text":", which Segment takes in place of the request’s address, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it records none. RudderStack fills in a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"request_ip"},{"type":"text","text":" from the request unless the call has one,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"even beside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"context.ip"},{"type":"text","text":", and passes it on to its destinations, so RudderStack’s calls also carry"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"request_ip"},{"type":"text","text":" as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0.0.0.0"},{"type":"text","text":". Customer.io’s references don’t say whether "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"context.ip"},{"type":"text","text":" takes the place"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the address it reads from an HTTP request, so it may still record the request’s."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each endpoint counts a user per "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"anonymousId"},{"type":"text","text":", so each session is one user in its reports, and so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is each record sent without a session. On a plan billed by monthly tracked users, each counts as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. A record a store recovers after a relaunch keeps its session, so it goes out under the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"anonymousId"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"messageId"},{"type":"text","text":" of its first send. Segment deduplicates calls by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"messageId"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drops most duplicates within about 24 hours, not all, so one it stored before the app ended is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"most likely not stored again. RudderStack’s and Customer.io’s API references don’t say whether"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"they deduplicate, so such a record may be stored twice there."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Properties are read through the event’s schema in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlan"},{"type":"text","text":" the encoder is made with. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sensitive"},{"type":"text","text":" value is never sent, whatever the record reveals. A record the encoder can’t write is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"left out and the rest of the batch is sent: one the plan doesn’t describe, one named as one of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Customer.io’s semantic events, which delete or suppress people and devices ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"User Deleted"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"User Suppressed"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Device Deleted"},{"type":"text","text":" and the rest), one whose event isn’t "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Encodable"},{"type":"text","text":", one holding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a value JSON can’t, one whose timestamp has no ISO 8601 form, and one too large for a call. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination reports each as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDropReport.skipped(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SkippedRecord"},{"type":"text","text":" whose reason is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/SegmentSpecEncodingError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and the encoder logs a notice for each semantic event name in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plan when the destination is made."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Segment answers 200 for every request but one too large or not JSON, so a wrong region, a write"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key of no source, or a batch of more calls than it takes may be answered 200 with nothing stored."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Check the source’s debugger after setting the destination up. RudderStack answers a wrong write"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key with 401, and Customer.io, in strict mode, with 401 too, so the destination reports those. In"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"strict mode Customer.io refuses a whole batch for one bad call, so the encoder leaves out each call"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Customer.io documents refusing; a 400 for anything else drops the whole request."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To send to PostHog, Amplitude or Mixpanel, use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PostHogEncoding"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AmplitudeEncoding"},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelEncoding"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import HTTPDestinations","import SegmentSpecEncoding","import TrackingPlans","","let plan = try TrackingPlan()","let segment = try HTTPDestination.segment(","    writeKey: writeKey,","    region: .us,  \/\/ or .eu, where the workspace is","    plan: plan)","let tracker = Tracker(enrichers: [.sessions()])","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: segment)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The guide ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"covers what each endpoint receives, and why, in more detail.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Send records as Segment-spec track calls to Segment, RudderStack or Customer.io Data Pipelines."}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SegmentSpecEncoding"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","title":"SegmentSpecEncoding","symbolKind":"module","externalID":"SegmentSpecEncoding"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/segmentspecencoding"]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/segment(writeKey:region:plan:backoff:clock:)","doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/segment(writeKey:region:plan:transport:backoff:clock:)","doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/SegmentRegion","doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/SegmentSetupError"],"anchor":"Sending-to-Segment","title":"Sending to Segment"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/rudderStack(writeKey:dataPlane:plan:backoff:clock:)","doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/rudderStack(writeKey:dataPlane:plan:transport:backoff:clock:)","doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/RudderStackSetupError"],"anchor":"Sending-to-RudderStack","title":"Sending to RudderStack"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/customerIO(apiKey:region:plan:backoff:clock:)","doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/customerIO(apiKey:region:plan:transport:backoff:clock:)","doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/CustomerIORegion","doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/CustomerIOSetupError"],"anchor":"Sending-to-Customerio-Data-Pipelines","title":"Sending to Customer.io Data Pipelines"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/SegmentSpecBatchEncoder"],"anchor":"Encoding-batches","title":"Encoding batches"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/SegmentSpecEncodingError"],"anchor":"Records-left-out","title":"Records left out"}],"references":{"doc://HTTPDestinations/documentation/HTTPDestinations/BatchEncoder":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BatchEncoder","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"BatchEncoder","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BatchEncoder","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"What turns a batch of records into the requests ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" sends.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/httpdestinations\/batchencoder"},"doc://SegmentSpecEncoding/documentation/SegmentSpecEncoding/CustomerIORegion":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CustomerIORegion","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"CustomerIORegion","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CustomerIORegion","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/segmentspecencoding\/customerioregion","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/CustomerIORegion","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The region of a Customer.io workspace, which decides the Pipelines API endpoint its events are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"posted to."}]},"doc://SegmentSpecEncoding/documentation/SegmentSpecEncoding/SegmentRegion":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SegmentRegion","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/SegmentRegion","role":"symbol","title":"SegmentRegion","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The region of a Segment workspace, which decides the batch endpoint its sources’ events are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"posted to."}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SegmentRegion","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/segmentspecencoding\/segmentregion"},"doc://SegmentSpecEncoding/documentation/SegmentSpecEncoding/HTTPDestinations/HTTPDestination/rudderStack(writeKey:dataPlane:plan:backoff:clock:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/rudderStack(writeKey:dataPlane:plan:backoff:clock:)","conformance":{"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Transport"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLSessionTransport"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Encoding"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SegmentSpecBatchEncoder"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}]},"title":"rudderStack(writeKey:dataPlane:plan:backoff:clock:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rudderStack","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"writeKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dataPlane","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials3URLV","text":"URL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"plan","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV","text":"TrackingPlan","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"backoff","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations18ExponentialBackoffV","text":"ExponentialBackoff","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"clock","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency5ClockP","text":"Clock","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:19SegmentSpecEncoding21RudderStackSetupErrorO","text":"RudderStackSetupError","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations15HTTPDestinationV","text":"HTTPDestination","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations19URLSessionTransportV","text":"URLSessionTransport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:19SegmentSpecEncoding0aB12BatchEncoderV","text":"SegmentSpecBatchEncoder","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that sends batches to the RudderStack source of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"writeKey"},{"type":"text","text":", through the data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plane at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dataPlane"},{"type":"text","text":", with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLSession.shared"},{"type":"text","text":", retrying a send that fails for now with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"waits of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"backoff"},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clock"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/segmentspecencoding\/httpdestinations\/httpdestination\/rudderstack(writekey:dataplane:plan:backoff:clock:)"},"doc://SegmentSpecEncoding/documentation/SegmentSpecEncoding/HTTPDestinations/HTTPDestination/customerIO(apiKey:region:plan:backoff:clock:)":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"customerIO","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"apiKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"region","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:19SegmentSpecEncoding16CustomerIORegionO","text":"CustomerIORegion","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"plan","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV","text":"TrackingPlan","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"backoff","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations18ExponentialBackoffV","text":"ExponentialBackoff","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"clock","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency5ClockP","text":"Clock","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:19SegmentSpecEncoding20CustomerIOSetupErrorO","text":"CustomerIOSetupError","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations15HTTPDestinationV","text":"HTTPDestination","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations19URLSessionTransportV","text":"URLSessionTransport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:19SegmentSp